OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry in the evening with clear spells.
OL,7,FClouding over from the southwest
OL,8,Fovernight with some outbreaks of rain
OL,9,Fand freshening south to southeast
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FIt will be cloudy with mostly
OL,13,Fpatchy light rain by day, but the rain
OL,14,Fturning heavier in the evening.
OL,15,FOccasionally strong winds around the
OL,16,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
