OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FEarly
OL,6,Frain clearing Tuesday morning, then
OL,7,Fsunshine and showers, windy at times.
OL,8,FVery windy Wednesday with coastal
OL,9,Fgales, clouding over with occasionally
OL,10,Fheavy rain later, this clearing later
OL,11,FThursday.
